CR4","description":"","creator":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":30,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-02-20T16:10:57Z","updated_at":"2016-03-21T12:47:46Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2016-03-21T12:39:18Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2016-03-04T23:44:54Z","updated_at":"2016-03-16T10:58:38Z","closed_at":"2016-03-16T10:58:38Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When resolving a domain name containing non-ASCII characters, Netty would send out DNS query but reject the response because the DnsQuestion doesn't match.\n\nFor example, when resolving www.äüöß.com, I'm getting:\n\n```\n04 Mar 2016 15:33:39,309 [WARN] (dns-response-handler-0) io.netty.resolver.dns.DnsQueryContext: Received a mismatching DNS response: DatagramDnsResponse(from: /x.x.x.x:53, to: /0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:59756, 1499, QUERY(0), ServFail(2), RD RA)\n    DefaultDnsQuestion(www.����.com IN A)\n    DefaultDnsRawRecord(OPT flags:0 udp:4000 0B)\n```\n\nLooks like it's caused by a difference in encoding. I think the resolver should either validate the input domain name based on http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc1738.txt, or just fix the encoding.\n","closed_by":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4937/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}